'''Escavalier''' (Japanese: '''シュバルゴ''' ''Chevargo'') is a {{ct|Metal}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

