==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unified Minds|Escavalier|142}} from the {{TCG|Unified Minds}} expansion.
*'''Pike''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Black & White|Samurott|31}} from the {{TCG|Black & White}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Omega Ruby}}.

